#: wjs/plugins/wjs_review/templates/wjs_review/evaluate_review/elements/info.html:6
msgid ""
"\n"
"      <p>\n"
"        Please accept/decline the invite by using the buttons below. After "
"accepting, you will be able to upload your review.\n"
"      </p>\n"
"      <p>\n"
"        Reviewers should declare <strong>potentially competing</strong> "
"financial issues, personal relationships, or academic <strong>interests that "
"could affect impartiality</strong>.<br>\n"
"        For example:\n"
"      </p>\n"
"      <ul>\n"
"        <li>working for the same institution as any of the authors; recent "
"collaboration with them (in the past 3 years); being joint grant holders</"
"li>\n"
"        <li>very similar manuscript to one you have in preparation or under "
"consideration</li>\n"
